    "source": "2024·海南卷·第14(1)题",
    "verified": true,
    "stem": "某同学利用如图所示装置测量水平圆盘转动时边缘小圆柱所受向心力。水平圆盘直径为 <b>D = 42.02 cm</b>，将质量为 <b>m = 30.0 g</b> 的小圆柱竖直放置在圆盘最外边缘（外壁与盘缘齐平），圆盘匀速转动 <b>10 周</b>用时 <b>62.8 s</b>（π 取 3.14）。用 <b>10 分度游标卡尺</b>测得小圆柱直径 d 如图所示。<br><svg viewBox=\"0 0 280 164\" width=\"280\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"圆盘与边缘小圆柱俯视示意图\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"272\" height=\"156\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#FBFCFE\" stroke=\"#CBD5E1\"/><circle cx=\"104\" cy=\"86\" r=\"48\" fill=\"#EEF2F6\" stroke=\"#596574\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"104\" cy=\"86\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#10233F\"/><circle cx=\"144\" cy=\"86\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#E6A85C\" stroke=\"#9A5A00\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"104\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"144\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#1661FF\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 2\"/><line x1=\"56\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"152\" y2=\"28\" stroke=\"#4A5B73\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"56\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"56\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#94A3B8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\"/><line x1=\"152\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"152\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#94A3B8\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\"/><text x=\"104\" y=\"21\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10233F\">D = 42.02 cm</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1661FF\">r</text><text x=\"158\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#9A5A00\">小圆柱 d</text><text x=\"104\" y=\"102\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#4A5B73\">O</text><path d=\"M 76 118 A 38 38 0 0 0 132 118\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#12A9C4\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><polygon points=\"135,115 129,122 138,123\" fill=\"#12A9C4\"/><text x=\"104\" y=\"151\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#0E8CA3\">匀速转动 ω</text></svg><br><svg viewBox=\"0 0 644 128\" width=\"644\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"10分度游标卡尺读数图（16.2 mm）\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"12\" width=\"632\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#F3F7FC\" stroke=\"#9AA8B8\"/><line x1=\"24.00\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"24.00\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#10233F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"57.65\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"57.65\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#10233F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"91.29\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"91.29\" y2=\"48\" stroke=\"#10233F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"124.94\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"124.94\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#10233F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"158.59\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"158.59\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#10233F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"192.24\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"192.24\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#10233F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"225.88\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"225.88\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#10233F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"259.53\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"259.53\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#10233F\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"259.53\" y=\"36\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10233F\">2</text><line x1=\"293.18\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"293.18\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#10233F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"326.82\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"326.82\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#10233F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"360.47\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"360.47\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#10233F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"394.12\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"394.12\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#10233F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"427.76\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"427.76\" y2=\"48\" stroke=\"#10233F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"461.41\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"461.41\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#10233F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"495.06\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"495.06\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#10233F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"528.71\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"528.71\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#10233F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"562.35\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"562.35\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#10233F\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"596.00\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"596.00\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#10233F\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"596.00\" y=\"36\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10233F\">3</text><text x=\"628\" y=\"36\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#4A5B73\">cm</text><rect x=\"71.11\" y=\"64\" width=\"379.39\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#E8EEF5\" stroke=\"#596574\"/><line x1=\"71.11\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"71.11\" y2=\"116\" stroke=\"#596574\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><line x1=\"131.67\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"131.67\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#1661FF\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"131.67\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1661FF\">0</text><line x1=\"161.95\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"161.95\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#10233F\" stroke-width=\"1.0\"/><line x1=\"192.24\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"192.24\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#10233F\" stroke-width=\"1.0\"/><line x1=\"222.52\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"222.52\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#10233F\" stroke-width=\"1.0\"/><line x1=\"252.80\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"252.80\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#10233F\" stroke-width=\"1.0\"/><line x1=\"283.08\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"283.08\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#10233F\" stroke-width=\"1.0\"/><text x=\"283.08\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"500\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10233F\">5</text><line x1=\"313.36\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"313.36\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#10233F\" stroke-width=\"1.0\"/><line x1=\"343.65\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"343.65\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#10233F\" stroke-width=\"1.0\"/><line x1=\"373.93\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"373.93\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#10233F\" stroke-width=\"1.0\"/><line x1=\"404.21\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"404.21\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#10233F\" stroke-width=\"1.0\"/><line x1=\"434.49\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"434.49\" y2=\"86\" stroke=\"#10233F\" stroke-width=\"1.0\"/><text x=\"434.49\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"500\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10233F\">10</text></svg>",
    "parts": [
      {
        "label": "(1)",
        "type": "numeric",
        "prompt": "小圆柱的直径 d =",
        "unit": "mm",
        "answer": 16.2,
        "tol": 0.1,
        "sig": 3,
        "show": "16.2",
        "explain": "10 分度游标卡尺主尺“2”左数第 4 条刻线为 16 mm，游标 0 刻线在 16 mm 与 17 mm 之间；游标第 2 条刻线与主尺对齐（精度 0.1 mm），故 d = 16 + 2 × 0.1 = 16.2 mm。"
      },
      {
        "label": "(2)",
        "type": "numeric",
        "prompt": "圆盘转动的角速度 ω =（保留 2 位有效数字）",
        "unit": "rad/s",
        "answer": 1.0,
        "tol": 0.05,
        "sig": 2,
        "show": "1.0",
        "explain": "周期 T = {{frac|62.8 s|10}} = 6.28 s，角速度 ω = {{frac|2π|T}} = {{frac|2 × 3.14|6.28}} = 1.0 rad/s。"
      },
      {
        "label": "(3)",
        "type": "expr",
        "prompt": "小圆柱转动时所需向心力大小的表达式为（用题目所给物理量 m、ω、D、d 表示）",
        "lhs": "F =",
        "vars": { "m": "m", "w": "ω", "D": "D", "d": "d" },
        "extra": ["1", "2", "4"],
        "answer": "m*w^2*(D-d)/2",
        "show": "mω²(D−d)/2",
        "explain": "小圆柱中心到圆盘圆心的距离 r = {{frac|D|2}} − {{frac|d|2}} = {{frac|D−d|2}}，代入向心力公式得 F = mω²r = {{frac|mω²(D−d)|2}}。"
      },
      {
        "label": "(4)",
        "type": "numeric",
        "prompt": "小圆柱所受向心力大小 F =（保留 2 位有效数字，可用 ×10^-3）",
        "unit": "N",
        "answer": 0.0061,
        "tol": 0.0002,
        "sig": 2,
        "show": "6.1×10^-3",
        "explain": "r = {{frac|0.4202 − 0.0162|2}} = 0.2020 m，m = 0.0300 kg，ω = 1.0 rad/s，故 F = 0.0300 × 1.0² × 0.2020 = 6.06 × 10⁻³ N ≈ 6.1 × 10⁻³ N。"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "G2",
    "source": "2025·北京卷·第16(4)题（节选·圆周向心加速度迁移）",
    "verified": true,
    "stem": "某同学用打点计时器来研究圆周运动。如图所示，将纸带的一端固定在水平圆盘边缘处的 M 点，另一端穿过打点计时器。实验时圆盘从静止开始转动，选取部分纸带如右图所示，相邻计数点 A、B、C、D、E 间的时间间隔均为 <b>T = 0.10 s</b>，圆盘半径 <b>R = 0.10 m</b>。各计数点到起点 A 的距离依次为 3.59 cm、8.00 cm、13.22 cm、19.24 cm。<br><svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 132\" width=\"560\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"圆盘边缘拉纸带与纸带计数点示意图\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"552\" height=\"124\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#FBFCFE\" stroke=\"#CBD5E1\"/><circle cx=\"66\" cy=\"68\" r=\"42\" fill=\"#EEF2F6\" stroke=\"#596574\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"66\" cy=\"68\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#10233F\"/><circle cx=\"66\" cy=\"26\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#C7374B\"/><text x=\"66\" y=\"19\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#C7374B\">M</text><line x1=\"66\" y1=\"68\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"96\" stroke=\"#4A5B73\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"87\" y=\"81\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#10233F\">R</text><line x1=\"66\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"156\" y2=\"26\" stroke=\"#7A5C3E\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><rect x=\"128\" y=\"16\" width=\"24\" height=\"20\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#C9D1D9\" stroke=\"#596574\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"10.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#4A5B73\">打点计时器</text><rect x=\"176\" y=\"44\" width=\"366\" height=\"32\" fill=\"#F6F1E3\" stroke=\"#BFAF86\"/><circle cx=\"196\" cy=\"60\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#10233F\"/><text x=\"196\" y=\"39\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A</text><text x=\"196\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"10.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#4A5B73\">0</text><circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"60\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#10233F\"/><text x=\"250\" y=\"39\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">B</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"10.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#4A5B73\">3.59</text><circle cx=\"316\" cy=\"60\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#10233F\"/><text x=\"316\" y=\"39\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">C</text><text x=\"316\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"10.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#4A5B73\">8.00</text><circle cx=\"398\" cy=\"60\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#10233F\"/><text x=\"398\" y=\"39\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">D</text><text x=\"398\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"10.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#4A5B73\">13.22</text><circle cx=\"498\" cy=\"60\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#10233F\"/><text x=\"498\" y=\"39\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">E</text><text x=\"498\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"10.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#4A5B73\">19.24 cm</text></svg>",
    "parts": [
      {
        "label": "(1)",
        "type": "numeric",
        "prompt": "这段纸带通过打点计时器的加速度大小（即圆盘边缘的切向加速度 a<sub>τ</sub>）为（保留 2 位有效数字）",
        "unit": "m/s²",
        "answer": 0.81,
        "tol": 0.02,
        "sig": 2,
        "show": "0.81",
        "explain": "用逐差法充分利用 4 段数据：x<sub>AC</sub> = 8.00 cm = 0.0800 m，x<sub>CE</sub> = (19.24 − 8.00) cm = 0.1124 m，则 a<sub>τ</sub> = {{frac|x<sub>CE</sub> − x<sub>AC</sub>|4T²}} = {{frac|0.1124 − 0.0800|4 × 0.10²}} = 0.81 m/s²。"
      },
      {
        "label": "(2)",
        "type": "numeric",
        "prompt": "打点计时器打 B 点时，圆盘边缘 M 点的向心加速度大小 a<sub>n</sub> =（保留 2 位有效数字）",
        "unit": "m/s²",
        "answer": 1.6,
        "tol": 0.05,
        "sig": 2,
        "show": "1.6",
        "explain": "打 B 点时边缘线速度 v<sub>B</sub> = {{frac|x<sub>AC</sub>|2T}} = {{frac|0.0800|2 × 0.10}} = 0.40 m/s；向心加速度 a<sub>n</sub> = {{frac|v<sub>B</sub>²|R}} = {{frac|0.40²|0.10}} = 1.6 m/s²（注意逐差法求得的是切向加速度，向心加速度必须由 v²/R 求出）。"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "Y1",
    "source": "原创",
    "verified": true,
    "stem": "如图所示为教材中的向心力演示器，转动手柄可使长槽和短槽分别随变速塔轮匀速转动。<br><svg viewBox=\"0 0 420 176\" width=\"420\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"向心力演示器原理示意图\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"412\" height=\"168\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#FBFCFE\" stroke=\"#CBD5E1\"/><rect x=\"99\" y=\"44\" width=\"6\" height=\"70\" fill=\"#8E99A6\" stroke=\"#596574\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"296\" y=\"44\" width=\"6\" height=\"70\" fill=\"#8E99A6\" stroke=\"#596574\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"42\" y=\"34\" width=\"120\" height=\"10\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#9AA8B8\" stroke=\"#596574\"/><rect x=\"258\" y=\"34\" width=\"82\" height=\"10\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#9AA8B8\" stroke=\"#596574\"/><circle cx=\"86\" cy=\"28\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#D5E0EB\" stroke=\"#596574\"/><circle cx=\"298\" cy=\"28\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#D5E0EB\" stroke=\"#596574\"/><text x=\"74\" y=\"59\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#4A5B73\">长槽</text><text x=\"272\" y=\"59\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#4A5B73\">短槽</text><rect x=\"170\" y=\"36\" width=\"14\" height=\"64\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#10233F\"/><rect x=\"170\" y=\"36\" width=\"14\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#1E293B\"/><rect x=\"170\" y=\"68\" width=\"14\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#1E293B\"/><rect x=\"224\" y=\"36\" width=\"14\" height=\"64\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#10233F\"/><rect x=\"224\" y=\"36\" width=\"14\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#1E293B\"/><rect x=\"224\" y=\"68\" width=\"14\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#1E293B\"/><text x=\"177\" y=\"25\" font-size=\"10.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">标尺1</text><text x=\"231\" y=\"25\" font-size=\"10.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">标尺2</text><rect x=\"72\" y=\"114\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#C9D1D9\" stroke=\"#596574\"/><rect x=\"62\" y=\"130\" width=\"80\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#B5C2D0\" stroke=\"#596574\"/><rect x=\"284\" y=\"114\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#C9D1D9\" stroke=\"#596574\"/><rect x=\"279\" y=\"130\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#B5C2D0\" stroke=\"#596574\"/><rect x=\"70\" y=\"118\" width=\"246\" height=\"6\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#7A5C3E\" opacity=\"0.88\"/><text x=\"102\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1661FF\">左塔轮 2R</text><text x=\"299\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1661FF\">右塔轮 R</text><line x1=\"319\" y1=\"137\" x2=\"382\" y2=\"137\" stroke=\"#596574\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"382\" y1=\"137\" x2=\"382\" y2=\"108\" stroke=\"#596574\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><rect x=\"376\" y=\"96\" width=\"12\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#C7374B\"/><text x=\"382\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"10.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#4A5B73\">手柄</text></svg>",
    "parts": [
      {
        "label": "(1)",
        "type": "choice",
        "prompt": "本实验同时探究向心力 F 与质量、半径、角速度三个量之间的关系，以及用黑白标尺露出格数显示向心力大小，分别主要采用的主要物理思想方法是？",
        "options": [
          "等效替代法、放大法",
          "控制变量法、转换法",
          "理想模型法、微元法",
          "类比法、累积法"
        ],
        "answer": 1,
        "explain": "依次固定其中两个量只改变第三个量是控制变量法；将弹簧弹力转换成标尺露出的等分格数是转换法。"
      },
      {
        "label": "(2)",
        "type": "choice",
        "prompt": "若左、右两槽内小球质量、转动半径均相同，皮带套在左塔轮半径 2R、右塔轮半径 R（即 R<sub>左</sub> : R<sub>右</sub> = 2 : 1）的轮盘上且不打滑，则匀速转动手柄时左、右两球角速度之比 ω<sub>左</sub> : ω<sub>右</sub> 与标尺露出格数之比 n<sub>左</sub> : n<sub>右</sub> 分别为？",
        "options": [
          "2 : 1，4 : 1",
          "1 : 2，1 : 4",
          "2 : 1，2 : 1",
          "1 : 2，1 : 2"
        ],
        "answer": 1,
        "replay": "E2",
        "explain": "皮带不打滑时边缘线速度相等，即 ω<sub>左</sub>R<sub>左</sub> = ω<sub>右</sub>R<sub>右</sub> ⇒ ω<sub>左</sub>:ω<sub>右</sub> = R<sub>右</sub>:R<sub>左</sub> = 1:2。由于 m、r 相同，F ∝ ω²，故 n<sub>左</sub>:n<sub>右</sub> = F<sub>左</sub>:F<sub>右</sub> = 1:4。"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "Y2",
    "source": "原创",
    "verified": true,
    "stem": "向心力演示器左侧长槽有内侧（半径 r）和外侧（半径 2r）两个挡板槽位，右侧短槽只有半径为 r 的槽位；备有质量为 m 的铝球和质量为 2m 的钢球，以及半径可调的变速塔轮。<br><svg viewBox=\"0 0 420 144\" width=\"420\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"长槽内外侧与短槽对比示意图\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"412\" height=\"136\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#FBFCFE\" stroke=\"#CBD5E1\"/><rect x=\"34\" y=\"52\" width=\"150\" height=\"12\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#9AA8B8\" stroke=\"#596574\"/><rect x=\"250\" y=\"52\" width=\"104\" height=\"12\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#9AA8B8\" stroke=\"#596574\"/><circle cx=\"174\" cy=\"58\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#10233F\"/><circle cx=\"262\" cy=\"58\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#10233F\"/><circle cx=\"124\" cy=\"44\" r=\"8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#12A9C4\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 2\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"124\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"10.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#0E8CA3\">内侧 r</text><circle cx=\"56\" cy=\"42\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#8E99A6\" stroke=\"#4A5B73\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"56\" y=\"25\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10233F\">外侧 2r (钢 2m)</text><circle cx=\"312\" cy=\"43\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#D5E0EB\" stroke=\"#596574\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"312\" y=\"25\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10233F\">短槽 r (铝 m)</text><line x1=\"56\" y1=\"82\" x2=\"174\" y2=\"82\" stroke=\"#1661FF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"97\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1661FF\">2r = 12.0 cm</text><line x1=\"262\" y1=\"82\" x2=\"312\" y2=\"82\" stroke=\"#1661FF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"287\" y=\"97\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1661FF\">r = 6.0 cm</text><text x=\"115\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#C7374B\">左塔轮半径 R</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#C7374B\">右塔轮半径 2R</text></svg>",
    "parts": [
      {
        "label": "(1)",
        "type": "choice",
        "prompt": "若要独立探究“向心力大小 F 与角速度 ω 的关系”，下列实验配置正确的是？",
